<title>UK: Oil minister Rasheed to head Iraqi OPEC delegation.</title>
<headline>Oil minister Rasheed to head Iraqi OPEC delegation.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iraqi Oil Minister Amer Mohammed Rasheed is expected to represent his country at OPEC ministerial talks in Vienna next week, OPEC sources said.</p>
<p>Rasheed is expected to arrive in the Austrian capital on Tuesday June 24, the day before the conference begins.</p>
<p>Iraq was represented at OPEC's previous twice-yearly conference in November by former oil minister and presidential advisor Osama al-Hiti.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 6280</p>
</text>
